                           <p data-animate="" data-animation="fade-in-up">College of DuPage is where ambition meets opportunity. At COD, students join a diverse,
                              vibrant community of learners, dreamers and doers—all committed to transforming their
                              futures.</p>
                           					
                           <div class="Hero__buttons Buttons" data-animate="" data-animation="fade-in-up">
