               <div class="Update">
                  		
                  <div class="Common">			
                     			
                     <h2 class="h4">Get Ready for Spring 2027</h2>		
                     			
                     			
                     <p>
                        <div class="elementToProof">
                           
                           <p class="p2">Registration for Spring 2027 is underway, with classes starting on Jan. 25, 2027.
                              <span>Don’t miss </span><a href="https://cod.edu/student-experience/new-student-orientation.html">New Student Orientation</a><span> (NSO) on Thursday, Jan. 14 to meet other students, explore campus resources and enjoy
                                 free food, swag and fun.</span></p>
                           </div>
                        
                        <div id="Signature" class="elementToProof"></div>
                     </p>
                     		</div>
                  		
